{
    "title": "Twiddle Finger Night Battle",
    "description": "Tonight Girlfriend puts Boyfriend on hold and leaves him to twiddle his finger until she can defeat Max - evil monkey in music battles. This time, GF rap battle as the coveted chicken nugget trying to escape evil monkey named Max, who is madly in love with GF and will stop at nothing to keep her.\r\nJoin Boyfriend and Girlfriend in Twiddle Finger Night Battles! Compete in epic musical showdowns and test your rhythm skills in this fun and challenging rhythm game. Enjoy the rhythm! Rock the beat! Dance along to sg5 music!\r\n\r\nGAMEPLAY\r\n- Tap the arrows in sync with the music to score points. The better your timing, the higher your score.\r\n- Each difficulty level offers a unique challenge and new high scores to achieve.\r\n- Challenge friends in competitive musical battles. Show off your skills and climb the leaderboards.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES\r\n- Face off against Boyfriend and Girfriend in fast-paced rhythm challenges.\r\n- Experience unique mods including Indie cross, Silly Billy, Skibidi and more.\r\n- Groove to hit singles like weekend 1 and hit single real.\r\n- Battle all horror characters like Tricky, Matt, Impostor V5.\r\n- Enjoy a visually stunning game community that brings the music to life.\r\n\r\nDownload now and join the ultimate musical showdown!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Tonight Girlfriend puts Boyfriend on hold and leaves him to twiddle his finger until she can defeat Max - evil monkey in music battles. This time, GF rap battle as the coveted chicken nugget trying to escape evil monkey named Max, who is madly in love with GF and will stop at nothing to keep her.<br>Join Boyfriend and Girlfriend in Twiddle Finger Night Battles! Compete in epic musical showdowns and test your rhythm skills in this fun and challenging rhythm game. Enjoy the rhythm! Rock the beat! Dance along to sg5 music!<br><br>GAMEPLAY<br>- Tap the arrows in sync with the music to score points. The better your timing, the higher your score.<br>- Each difficulty level offers a unique challenge and new high scores to achieve.<br>- Challenge friends in competitive musical battles. Show off your skills and climb the leaderboards.<br><br>KEY FEATURES<br>- Face off against Boyfriend and Girfriend in fast-paced rhythm challenges.<br>- Experience unique mods including Indie cross, Silly Billy, Skibidi and more.<br>- Groove to hit singles like weekend 1 and hit single real.<br>- Battle all horror characters like Tricky, Matt, Impostor V5.<br>- Enjoy a visually stunning game community that brings the music to life.<br><br>Download now and join the ultimate musical showdown!",
